OL,3,ANicotine vapes best chance to quit
OL,4,Asmoking, major review finds
OL,5,
OL,6,FThey outperformed non-nicotine vapes
OL,7,Ftoo, although researchers say switching
OL,8,Fto these afterwards might help with
OL,9,Fweaning off nicotine.
OL,11,FAnd they could prove more effective
OL,12,Fthan the new anti-smoking pill
OL,13,Fcytisine, which the NHS has started to
OL,14,Froll out - although more research is
OL,15,Fneeded.
